          desc: "A nostalgic music player website built with Astro, featuring 5 of my favorite songs. Designed to mimic the warm, tactile experience of an old vinyl record player. Each track carries personal memories and moments I hold dear. Fully designed and developed by me, now live and published.",
          type: "Project",
          stack: "Astro",
          status: "Live",
          owner: "Arai Nanami Rachel",
          url: "https://myvinyl.vercel.app/",
          image: "/images/myvinylcover.png",
        },
        p2: {
